==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**17,000 grants +1 Rare Cat Ticket.
**17,100 grants +1 [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Shard]].
**17,200 grants +5 Catamin As.
*Added 1 new enemy type: [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]].
*Added Behemoth type to [[Ragin' Gory]], [[Ultima Beast Naala]] and [[Wild Doge]].
*Added 1 new [[Special Abilities|Special Ability]]: [[Behemoth Slayer]].
**Damage dealt to Behemoths is increased, damage taken from them is decreased, and there is a set chance to dodge their attacks.
*[[Adventurer Kanna (Uber Rare Cat)|Adventurer Kanna]]'s attacks now have effective ranges of 300~800 on the 1st hit, 250~750 on the 2nd hit and 500~1,000 on the 3rd hit, rather than 300~700 on every hit.
*Added 5 new [[Catfruit#Behemoth Stones|evolution materials]] obtained from new stages.
*Raised maximum [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]] Level to 6.
*Added Li'l Cat [[Cat Scratcher]].

==Trivia==
*With the exceptions of the [[Dagshund]]s in [[Lonely Goldfish]] and the [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] in [[A Pile of Guts]], all the spawn timer changes were for enemies whose minimum spawn time was higher than the maximum.

